Package: longbet
Type: Package
Title: longbet: Bayesian Ensemble Trees for Causal Inference on Longitudinal Data
Version: 0.4.0
Date: 2026-09-05
Author: Meijia Wang, P. Richard Hahn, Ignacio Martinez
Maintainer: Meijia Wang <maggiew614@gmail.com>
Description: Time-varying conditional average treatment effect estimation with a 
  tree-based method providing separate regularization for the treatment and 
  prognostic terms. This fork adds unit-level random intercepts, fixes the
  covariance factorisation used when sampling and extrapolating the shared
  time factor, and makes the Gaussian process projection reproducible.
URL: https://github.com/ignacio82/longbet
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
Imports: Rcpp (>= 0.12.13)
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppArmadillo
NeedsCompilation: yes
RoxygenNote: 7.1.1
